ngterm: forward an explicit libc description to Wuffs under Zig 0.17

Original ngterm build adaptation for LIBGHOSTTY_VT_REV (Ghostty v1.4.0).
Zig's configurer never sees --libc. Accept -Dlibc-file alongside it and
forward the option through both Wuffs dependency sites to translate-c.
Without the option, retain translate-c's existing SDK detection.
Reason, upstream status and remove-when: build/patches/ghostty-vt/README.md.
Applied by scripts/build-ghostty-vt.sh. No header changes.

